  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You get hit high on the leg…very high. One of your buttocks now has two holes in it, one small, one slightly larger. Painful and embarrassing!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You miss your next Action as your eyes widen and you contemplate the nature of your new wound. You also suffer a penalty of -1 to your M and -20 to your Agility for the rest of the encounter. </p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
